{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》於昨日（11月11日）播出第4集預告，44歲陳自瑤與昔日好姊妹傅嘉莉為爭奪馬國明爆發激烈衝突。鏡頭前陳自瑤慘遭情敵連環掌摑近30巴，清脆巴掌聲震撼全網觀眾。這場充滿火藥味戲中戲背後原來暗藏極大玄機，兩位女演員極度逼真演出更意外揭開一張錯綜複雜復仇羅網。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉於《玫瑰戰爭》連環怒摑情敵</h2>\n<p>在昨日首度曝光預告片段中，傅嘉莉飾演梁菲雅早已對馬國明飾演李德龍情根深種，卻意外揭發男方暗中與陳自瑤飾演關子盈發展地下情。兩女在劇中爆發激烈正面衝突，陳自瑤不僅毫無退縮更當面挑釁宣戰，直斥對方絕不可能與男方在一起。被妒火衝昏頭腦下，傅嘉莉瞬間目露兇光並毫不留情起手狠摑陳自瑤。在這場戲中戲拍攝情節中，傅嘉莉更借故連環NG，對陳自瑤摑完再摑，令對方慘遭狂摑近30巴，清脆巴掌聲極具壓迫感。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077478410470_8767511796af573772e5fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933985.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077478410470_8767511796af573772e5fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077659051090_10653493066af5737912624.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933986.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077659051090_10653493066af5737912624.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077815930888_14576944836af5737b27611.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933987.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447077815930888_14576944836af5737b27611.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>陳自瑤展現專業主動要求傅嘉莉真打</h2>\n<p>面對如此火藥味濃郁場面，陳自瑤事後受訪時親自解開拍攝內幕。她笑言當時傅嘉莉在戲中戲故意NG並連環掌摑舉動太過逼真，一度嚇呆同場同劇演員楊茜堯。楊茜堯當時信以為真，誤以為兩人私底下「面和心不和」並借拍劇公報私仇，直到後來得悉純屬劇情安排才鬆一口氣。向來敬業樂業陳自瑤透露，為追求最真實畫面效果與戲劇張力，拍攝前她主動要求傅嘉莉不要遷就或留力，務求親自「真打」上陣。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078089162606_7478066626af5737db5d74.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933988.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078089162606_7478066626af5737db5d74.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯誓死為摯友討回公道展開復仇</h2>\n<p>除了這場令人震驚掌摑戲碼，這宗激烈衝突更將牽扯出當年轟動全城出軌風波。隨《玫瑰戰爭》劇情發展踏入白熱化階段，楊茜堯在得悉摯友枉死真相後，決定展開一連串精密復仇大計，誓要令所有背叛者付出沉重代價。預告尾聲更出現一段充滿暗示性神秘交收畫面，預示幕後黑手即將浮出水面，這場娛樂圈閨密互撕風暴才剛剛在螢幕前拉開序幕。</p>\n<h2>觀眾熱議《玫瑰戰爭》大讚演員敬業</h2>\n<p>劇集片段曝光後迅速引發網上熱烈討論，大批觀眾對這場極具衝擊力掌摑戲感到震驚。不少網民紛紛留言大讚兩位女演員表現，有人直指「連摑30巴真係睇見都覺得痛」，亦有觀眾被陳自瑤專業態度折服，表示「Yoyo為部劇真係博到盡非常敬業」。另一方面，觀眾亦對後續懸疑發展充滿期待，不斷留言猜測幕後黑手真正身分，並表示「好想快啲睇楊茜堯點樣報仇」，引發各大討論區關注。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078289269334_16839141316af57380002dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933983.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078289269334_16839141316af57380002dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078700316473_13442910976af573841d4a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933984.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447078700316473_13442910976af573841d4a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079104264999_21274150386af573880cab8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933991.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079104264999_21274150386af573880cab8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079372115253_17154299166af5738a2825d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933992.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079372115253_17154299166af5738a2825d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079514258520_11500259986af5738b8174b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6316776275778933989.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447079514258520_11500259986af5738b8174b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.044507+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1278,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:06:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:23.719285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:23.719285+00:00","content_hash":"24087181767508a006338af5975ca6b6b4cfc2309faa2bf3f9ba68c577d02bbc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}